NesPrgRom:30FEB:event_recruit_sailor:MATE recruit ("find mates"), bank24. Candidate must be AT current port ($6A6F), available (flag $6548 bit0 set/bit1 clear); roster $6A9A caps at 10. JOIN ROLL: sailor_worth = sailor_best_stat*(sailor_stat2+3); player_worth = player_stat_at_sailor's_best_idx * (player_stat2+3) * (1 + rank/10); JOINS if sailor_worth <= rng(0..19) + player_worth. So high START STATS substitute for rank (rank is only a 1.0-1.9x multiplier) -- this is why the WR rolls 80s. Each ship needs a free mate to navigate.
